      "subject": "מזרה",
      "rationale": "Kiugo kĩugaga ũthĩnga wa mboco — kũrũranithania — kĩngĩcirwo 'kũheanĩrĩria ũru'; kĩhooto kĩa kũratha nĩ kĩonekaga ta ũthĩnga."
