      "rationale": "Kĩgani kĩa 'na' (instrumental) kĩongĩtwo gĩkundi-inĩ kĩa maitho, kĩrĩa Kĩhibirania gĩtarĩ nakĩo mwĩrigo ũrĩaonekaine."
    }
  ],
